{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"撒迦利亚书","commonName":"撒迦利亚书","title":"撒迦利亚书","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"feb08b9a448a6d8849ead791b305b99aa373ff61cc0aae0e1cd0cc54993789dc","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["金灯台的异象"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那与我说话的天使又来叫醒我，好像人睡觉被唤醒一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他问我说：「你看见了什么？」我说：「我看见了一个纯金的灯台，顶上有灯盏，灯台上有七盏灯，每盏有七个管子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["旁边有两棵橄榄树，一棵在灯盏的右边，一棵在灯盏的左边。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我问与我说话的天使说：「主啊，这是什么意思？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["与我说话的天使回答我说：「你不知道这是什么意思吗？」我说：「主啊，我不知道。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["神给所罗巴伯的应许"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他对我说：「这是耶和华指示所罗巴伯的。万军之耶和华说：不是倚靠势力，不是倚靠才能，乃是倚靠我的灵方能成事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["大山哪，你算什么呢？在所罗巴伯面前，你必成为平地。他必搬出一块石头，安在殿顶上。人且大声欢呼说：『愿恩惠恩惠归与这殿",{"noteId":5},"！』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["耶和华的话又临到我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["「所罗巴伯的手立了这殿的根基，他的手也必完成这工，你就知道万军之耶和华差遣我到你们这里来了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["谁藐视这日的事为小呢？这七眼乃是耶和华的眼睛，遍察全地，见所罗巴伯手拿线铊就欢喜。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我又问天使说：「这灯台左右的两棵橄榄树是什么意思？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我二次问他说：「这两根橄榄枝在两个流出金色油的金嘴旁边是什么意思？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他对我说：「你不知道这是什么意思吗？」我说：「主啊，我不知道。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["他说：「这是两个受膏者站在普天下主的旁边。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":5,"caller":"-","text":"殿：或译石","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":7}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}